| `docs_module` / `docs_framework` | `{{ docs_module | default('disabled') }}` / `{{ docs_framework }}` | Not `docs_site`. Frameworks: `sphinx-shibuya`, `fumadocs`, `docusaurus`. |
| `shared_logic` | `{{ shared_logic }}` | Cross-module helpers shared by CLI/APIs. |
| `saas_infra_module` | `{{ saas_infra_module | default('disabled') }}` | Not `saas_starter_module`. |
| `saas_auth_module` / `saas_auth_provider` | `{{ saas_auth_module | default('disabled') }}` / `{{ saas_auth_provider | default('none') }}` | Not `saas_auth`. |
| `saas_billing_module` / `saas_billing_provider` | `{{ saas_billing_module | default('disabled') }}` / `{{ saas_billing_provider | default('none') }}` | Not `saas_billing`. |
| `saas_admin_dashboard` | `{{ saas_admin_dashboard | default(false) }}` | Not `include_admin`. |
| `openspec_extra` | `{{ openspec_extra | default('disabled') }}` | Optional; **default disabled**. Does not gate `mise.toml`. |
| mise.toml | always-on | No Copier toggle. Pins Python 3.11, Node 22, pnpm, uv. |

